ViridianCity_Interior6_Text_Gentleman::
	.string "Whew... I’m taking a rest from\n"
	.string "POKéMON battles.$"

ViridianCity_Interior6_Text_CableClubReceptionist::
	.string "Welcome to TRAINER HOUSE, the newest\n"
	.string "and most happening place in VIRIDIAN.\p"
	.string "We’re open to trainers only.\p"
	.string "You can battle against the best\n"
	.string "of the best right downstairs.$"

ViridianCity_Interior6_Text_CooltrainerM::
	.string "I guess you can’t become the CHAMP\n"
	.string "unless you go all over the place\l"
	.string "and battle all kinds of people.\p"
	.string "The CHAMPION from PALLET traveled\n"
	.string "to all the cities and towns in KANTO.$"

ViridianCity_Interior6_Text_CooltrainerF::
	.string "They hold practice battles\n"
	.string "downstairs here.\p"
	.string "I would love to see how well a\n"
	.string "trainer from JOHTO battles.$"

ViridianCity_Interior6_Text_Boy::
	.string "VIRIDIAN is the town closest to\n"
	.string "INDIGO PLATEAU.\p"
	.string "They built this place because so\n"
	.string "many trainers pass through on their\l"
	.string "way up to INDIGO PLATEAU.$"

ViridianCity_Interior6_Text_Trigger1_1::
	.string "Hi. Welcome to our TRAINING HALL.\p"
	.string "You may battle a trainer once per\n"
	.string "day.\p"
	.string "CAL is your opponent today.\n"
	.string "Would you like to battle?$"

ViridianCity_Interior6_Text_Trigger1_2::
	.string "Sorry, Only those trainers who will\n"
	.string "be battling are allowed to go in.$"

ViridianCity_Interior6_Text_Trigger1_3::
	.string "Please go right through.\n"
	.string "You may begin right away.$"

ViridianCity_Interior6_Text_Trigger1_4::
	.string "I traveled out here just so I\n"
	.string "could battle you.$"

ViridianCity_Interior6_Text_Trigger1Defeat::
	.string "I lost...\n"
	.string "Darn...$"

ViridianCity_Interior6_Text_Trigger1Victory::
	.string "YES!$"
